{"id":"n24793-2-6","stage":3,"title":"자원 · 资源","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24793-2-6-1","ko":"우리 학생들은 나라를 이끌어 갈 소중한 자원입니다.","zh":"我们的学生们是能够引领国家的宝贵人才。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"학생들은","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학생들은","audio":"/audio/5227ecc58cdf8d5079a2.mp3"}},{"text":"나라를","meaning":"国，国家","explanation":"나라：国，国家；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나라를","audio":"/audio/c841452ad530697c3ba3.mp3"}},{"text":"이끌어","meaning":"引导","explanation":"이끌다：引导；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"이끌다","audio":"/audio/90029ec3072fe5ec2979.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17971","senseId":"3","lemma":"이끌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이끌어","audio":"/audio/75a568ca965c9599cfbd.mp3"}},{"text":"갈","meaning":"到达，迈向","explanation":"가다：到达，迈向；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"9","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈","audio":"/audio/eb4ba4907fe859283419.mp3"}},{"text":"소중한","meaning":"珍贵","explanation":"소중하다：珍贵；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"소중하다","audio":"/audio/08fb30fbfd8d553f8fbe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49253","senseId":"1","lemma":"소중하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소중한","audio":"/audio/7c2224be1823ffe56bd7.mp3"}},{"text":"자원입니다.","meaning":"资源","explanation":"자원：资源；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"자원","audio":"/audio/df4ee15a028f0dc884b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24793","senseId":"2","lemma":"자원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자원입니다","audio":"/audio/809e6daa6bf4312f1654.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"f24650b42089c29f","term":"학생","zh":"学生","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3","entryId":"31670","definition":"在学校学习的人。","pronunciation":["학쌩"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]},{"id":"90029ec3072fe5ec","term":"이끌다","zh":"引导","audio":"/audio/90029ec3072fe5ec2979.mp3","entryId":"17971","definition":"引领人或团体并主导下去。","pronunciation":["이끌다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"到达，迈向","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"朝向某种状态或状况前进。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"08fb30fbfd8d553f","term":"소중하다","zh":"珍贵","audio":"/audio/08fb30fbfd8d553f8fbe.mp3","entryId":"49253","definition":"非常宝贵。","pronunciation":["소ː중하다"]},{"id":"df4ee15a028f0dc8","term":"자원","zh":"资源","audio":"/audio/df4ee15a028f0dc884b2.mp3","entryId":"24793","definition":"用于人们生活或经济生产的劳动力或技术。","pronunciation":["자원"]}],"audio":"/audio/b21e6b24520c4aaa20d4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24793-2-6-2","ko":"네, 가정에서도 잘 가르치겠습니다.","zh":"是的，我会在家里好好教导他们。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"가정에서도","meaning":"家庭，家园","explanation":"가정：家庭，家园；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"가정","audio":"/audio/4b987d4b6a865acd1c42.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59900","senseId":"1","lemma":"가정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가정에서도","audio":"/audio/cd84a03b7b2e8ca36370.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"가르치겠습니다.","meaning":"教，教授，传授","explanation":"가르치다：教，教授，传授；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"가르치다","audio":"/audio/b630a8848339bddb2b9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62255","senseId":"1","lemma":"가르치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가르치겠습니다","audio":"/audio/a94f8dc49b363e84b8e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"4b987d4b6a865acd","term":"가정","zh":"家庭，家园","audio":"/audio/4b987d4b6a865acd1c42.mp3","entryId":"59900","definition":"由一家人组成的共同体或他们生活的家。","pronunciation":["가정"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"b630a8848339bddb","term":"가르치다","zh":"教，教授，传授","audio":"/audio/b630a8848339bddb2b9f.mp3","entryId":"62255","definition":"说明知识或技术等，使熟知。","pronunciation":["가르치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c703d5a8871bd393e69c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.762,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24793","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license"